Output of charge and kinetic-energy density for SCAN.

The references include local XC terms at finite density and zero density
gradient. The previous gradient mask suppressed those local terms.
Real-space SCF convergence at 1e-9, inner diagonalization at 1e-12 and
12-digit cube output resolve both fields at the existing pointwise limits:
1e-6 for charge and 1e-8 for kinetic-energy density. References come from
an independent CG calculation; cross-checks use CG, Davidson and PPCG.
The structure, pseudopotential, basis, band count and mixing are unchanged.
